<title>HONG KONG: Joyce Boutique interim net down 70.7 pct.</title>
<headline>Joyce Boutique interim net down 70.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended September 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   3.3    vs  13.4</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    1.0    vs  3.5</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil    vs  nil</p>
<p>    Net			    10.18  vs  34.73</p>
<p>    Turnover		     462.70 vs  496.12</p>
<p>    Company name		 Joyce Boutique Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  January 6-9, 1997</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   January 22, 1997</p>
<p>NOTE - Joyce Boutique retails high fashion garments and accessories and publishes magazines.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
